<view class="page"><view class="appbar"><view><view class="appbar-title">学分缺口与选课规划</view><view class="appbar-sub">只列仍有缺口的课组，完整课程请到“课程”页核对</view></view></view><view class="section-title">所缺学分</view><view class="list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="group.id" class="row"><view class="tag warning">缺 {{item.missingCredits}} 学分{{item.missingCourseCount ? ' / ' + item.missingCourseCount + ' 门' : ''}}</view><text class="strong">{{item.group.name}}</text><text>要求 {{item.group.requiredCredits}} · 已获 {{item.earnedCredits}} · 在修 {{item.inProgressCredits}} · 规划 {{item.plannedCredits}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="panel empty">当前没有未满足的培养方案要求。</view></view><view class="section-heading"><view class="section-title">未选必修</view><text>{{required.length}} 门</text></view><view class="list"><button wx:for="{{required}}" wx:key="course.id" class="row" data-id="{{item.course.id}}" bindtap="openCourse"><view class="tag warning">{{item.course.status === 'FAILED' ? '未通过' : item.course.displayNature}}</view><text class="strong">{{item.course.courseName}}</text><text>{{item.course.courseCode || '代码待确认'}} · {{item.course.credits}} 学分 · {{item.course.displayTerm}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.requirementText}}">对应：{{item.requirementText}}</text><text class="advice">{{item.course.advice}}</text></button></view><view class="section-heading"><view class="section-title">限修 / 选修候选</view><text>{{limited.length}} 门可选</text></view><view class="notice">只需按各课组规定补足学分或门数，不需要修完整个课程池。</view><view class="list"><button wx:for="{{limited}}" wx:key="course.id" class="row" data-id="{{item.course.id}}" bindtap="openCourse"><view class="tag">{{item.course.displayNature}}</view><text class="strong">{{item.course.courseName}}</text><text>{{item.course.courseCode || '代码待确认'}} · {{item.course.credits}} 学分 · {{item.course.displayTerm}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.requirementText}}">对应：{{item.requirementText}}</text><text class="advice">{{item.course.advice}}</text></button></view></view>
<view class="module-tabbar"><navigator class="module-tab" url="/plan/pages/index/index" open-type="redirect">概览</navigator><navigator class="module-tab active" url="/plan/pages/requirements/requirements" open-type="redirect">培养方案</navigator><navigator class="module-tab" url="/plan/pages/courses/courses" open-type="redirect">课程</navigator><navigator class="module-tab" url="/plan/pages/source/source" open-type="redirect">数据源</navigator><navigator class="module-tab module-home" url="/pages/portal/portal" open-type="reLaunch">NaviStudy</navigator></view>
